[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7625.83, "timestamp": "02:07:05", "text": "啊，喜欢聊天。是的，很多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7628.55, "timestamp": "02:07:08", "text": "这些大主播们遇到麻烦了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7631.709, "timestamp": "02:07:11", "text": "我想正是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7633.99, "timestamp": "02:07:13", "text": "是啊，我有点害怕进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7636.069, "timestamp": "02:07:16", "text": "流媒体播放出现问题。我也很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7643.75, "timestamp": "02:07:23", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7646.31, "timestamp": "02:07:26", "text": "我开始使用一个叫做Beam的平台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7649.27, "timestamp": "02:07:29", "text": "溪流。这真是太好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7651.91, "timestamp": "02:07:31", "text": "多路复现。那就像是为……而做的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7653.75, "timestamp": "02:07:33", "text": "自由的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7656.069, "timestamp": "02:07:36", "text": "好多了。它有吗？它有任何吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7660.31, "timestamp": "02:07:40", "text": "限制？没有。您可以向 M22 Plus 串流播放。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7663.109, "timestamp": "02:07:43", "text": "双方。我可以等吗？我可以观看直播吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7665.27, "timestamp": "02:07:45", "text": "也像垂直流一样吗？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7668.35, "timestamp": "02:07:48", "text": "垂直方向也是如此。这是好事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7671.27, "timestamp": "02:07:51", "text": "部分。你可以添加两个 YouTube 频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.27, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "账户和嗯，安装垂直插件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7677.229, "timestamp": "02:07:57", "text": "并添加垂直方向"}]